        "letterSpacing": "",
        "html": "<div class=\"absolute top-[5px] left-0 w-full text-[22px] text-zinc-400 font-medium font-['MiSans'] leading-relaxed select-none\">厘清壁纸电视品类优势与品牌定位矩阵。</div><div class=\"absolute w-[1500px] flex items-center justify-between select-none animate-fadeIn overflow-visible\" style=\"top: 120px; left: 170px; height: 580px;\"><div class=\"relative w-[750px] h-[580px] bg-gray-50 rounded-l-3xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] p-16 pr-20 flex flex-col justify-between border-r border-zinc-200 text-black z-10 pl-10\"><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[40px] bg-gradient-to-l from-black/12 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"text-[18px] text-zinc-400 font-bold tracking-wider font-sans\">5 July 2026</div><div class=\"my-auto space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-[76px] font-black text-zinc-950 font-sans leading-none tracking-wide\">创维电视</h2><h2 class=\"text-[58px] font-black text-zinc-800 font-sans leading-snug\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI</span>品牌定位报告</h2></div><div class=\"text-[18px] text-zinc-400 font-bold font-sans\">GEO 索引未来项目组</div></div><div class=\"absolute w-[18px] h-[48px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-zinc-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-400 via-zinc-150 to-zinc-400 shadow-md z-30\" style=\"left: 741px; top: 60px;\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-[18px] h-[48px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-zinc-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-400 via-zinc-150 to-zinc-400 shadow-md z-30\" style=\"left: 741px; top: 160px;\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-[18px] h-[48px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-zinc-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-400 via-zinc-150 to-zinc-400 shadow-md z-30\" style=\"left: 741px; top: 260px;\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-[18px] h-[48px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-zinc-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-400 via-zinc-150 to-zinc-400 shadow-md z-30\" style=\"left: 741px; top: 360px;\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-[18px] h-[48px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-zinc-300 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-400 via-zinc-150 to-zinc-400 shadow-md z-30\" style=\"left: 741px; top: 460px;\"></div><div class=\"relative w-[750px] h-[580px] bg-white rounded-r-3xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] p-16 pl-20 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[40px] bg-gradient-to-r from-black/12 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col h-full py-4 justify-between\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex items-start border-b border-zinc-150 py-4 pr-4 gap-5\"><span class=\"font-['Montserrat'] text-[46px] font-black text-blue-600 shrink-0 leading-none\">1.</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 min-w-0 pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-[34px] font-black text-zinc-950 font-sans leading-snug\">壁纸电视 VS 常规电视</h3><p class=\"text-[22px] text-zinc-400 font-normal font-['MiSans'] leading-relaxed\">消费者为什么买壁纸电视，而不是传统电视？</p></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 flex items-start border-b border-zinc-150 py-4 pr-4 gap-5\"><span class=\"font-['Montserrat'] text-[46px] font-black text-blue-600 shrink-0 leading-none\">2.</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 min-w-0 pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-[34px] font-black text-zinc-950 font-sans leading-snug\">创维壁纸电视 VS 竞品壁纸电视</h3><p class=\"text-[22px] text-zinc-400 font-normal font-['MiSans'] leading-relaxed\">消费者为什么买创维壁纸电视，而不是竞品壁纸电视？</p></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 flex items-start pt-6 pr-4 gap-5\"><span class=\"font-['Montserrat'] text-[46px] font-black text-blue-600 shrink-0 leading-none\">3.</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 min-w-0 pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-[34px] font-black text-zinc-950 font-sans leading-tight\">创维五款壁纸电视的区别</h3><p class=\"text-[22px] text-zinc-400 font-normal font-['MiSans'] leading-relaxed\">消费者如果买创维壁纸电视，会选择哪一款？</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
